    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, build a home, and fight off the monsters. As nature corrupts around you, you too must become a monster to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/fea0d6c908ef6c73147b29389dd39e6e.poster.avif?t=1752783706\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/fea0d6c908ef6c73147b29389dd39e6e.webm?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/fea0d6c908ef6c73147b29389dd39e6e.mp4?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witherwood - a place known for its twisted and mutating fauna. Some try to study the oddities of Witherwood. Some try to harness its power.... But the locals avoid it at all costs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wisp awakens you as you sleepwalk through the forest. Confused and in dire danger, you undergo your first mutation.<br><br>Choose your mutation path:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ravel:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around the forest and hunt from the skies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/0a04ccc56873355623dfecbab6469815.poster.avif?t=1752783706\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/0a04ccc56873355623dfecbab6469815.webm?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/0a04ccc56873355623dfecbab6469815.mp4?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wolf:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about speed and endurance. Outlast your prey with critical timed strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mantis:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scitter, fly, and evade your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/70c533fc816220ce2039ba389d28565a.poster.avif?t=1752783706\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/70c533fc816220ce2039ba389d28565a.webm?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/70c533fc816220ce2039ba389d28565a.mp4?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bear:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow large, sharp claws. Overpower your prey with shear ferocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a thick layer of bark over your skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fungal Mutation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devour all dead and poisoned matter. Weaken your oppponents with damage over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND MORE!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a versatile combat system. Jump, roll, block attacks, imbue your weapons with poison; each equipment impacts the game and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/faa137a7ed6b4bb6e74e512638f1348f.poster.avif?t=1752783706\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/faa137a7ed6b4bb6e74e512638f1348f.webm?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/faa137a7ed6b4bb6e74e512638f1348f.mp4?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, build a home, and fight off the monsters. As nature corrupts around you, you too must become a monster to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/fea0d6c908ef6c73147b29389dd39e6e.poster.avif?t=1752783706\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/fea0d6c908ef6c73147b29389dd39e6e.webm?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/fea0d6c908ef6c73147b29389dd39e6e.mp4?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witherwood - a place known for its twisted and mutating fauna. Some try to study the oddities of Witherwood. Some try to harness its power.... But the locals avoid it at all costs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wisp awakens you as you sleepwalk through the forest. Confused and in dire danger, you undergo your first mutation.<br><br>Choose your mutation path:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ravel:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around the forest and hunt from the skies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/0a04ccc56873355623dfecbab6469815.poster.avif?t=1752783706\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/0a04ccc56873355623dfecbab6469815.webm?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/0a04ccc56873355623dfecbab6469815.mp4?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wolf:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about speed and endurance. Outlast your prey with critical timed strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mantis:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scitter, fly, and evade your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/70c533fc816220ce2039ba389d28565a.poster.avif?t=1752783706\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/70c533fc816220ce2039ba389d28565a.webm?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/70c533fc816220ce2039ba389d28565a.mp4?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bear:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow large, sharp claws. Overpower your prey with shear ferocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a thick layer of bark over your skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fungal Mutation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devour all dead and poisoned matter. Weaken your oppponents with damage over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND MORE!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a versatile combat system. Jump, roll, block attacks, imbue your weapons with poison; each equipment impacts the game and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/faa137a7ed6b4bb6e74e512638f1348f.poster.avif?t=1752783706\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/faa137a7ed6b4bb6e74e512638f1348f.webm?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/faa137a7ed6b4bb6e74e512638f1348f.mp4?t=1752783706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Witherwood is an openworld survival craft game with RPG and horror elements. Survive by building shelter and mutating along-side the fauna around you. Build a base. Craft impactful gear. Fight corrupted creatures. Make it back home If you can....",
